Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3, pipewire, pipewire-pulse, systemd
Description: PipeWire network audio client
 PipeWire Network Client provides a reliable way to receive RTP audio streams
 from a remote PipeWire server and create local sinks for network audio
 playback. It includes automatic reconnection, configuration management, and
 health monitoring.
 .
 This package installs the client component that receives RTP streams from
 remote PipeWire servers and creates local sinks for network audio playback.
